cff-version: 1.2.0
title: EvalGlass
message: "If you use EvalGlass in your work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "EvalGlass"
    email: contact@evalglass.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/EvalGlass/evalglass-core"
url: "https://github.com/EvalGlass/evalglass-core"
abstract: >-
  EvalGlass is a local-first, no-false-confidence evaluation framework for agentic
  AI applications, delivered as a Claude Code and Codex plugin. It measures the quality of
  LLM calls from host-owned evidence and reports only what the evidence honestly
  supports — a single Verdict Engine, typed authority, and an informational-by-default
  posture that never implies more than the run earned.
keywords:
  - llm-evaluation
  - ai-safety
  - evaluation
  - scorecard
  - groundedness
  - local-first
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
